<title>USA: NHL-TUESDAY'S STANLEY CUP PLAYOFF RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NHL-TUESDAY'S STANLEY CUP PLAYOFF RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of first-round National Hockey League Stanley Cup playoff games on Tuesday (home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>	     Eastern Conference</p>
<p> New Jersey    6  MONTREAL    4</p>
<p>(New Jersey leads best-of-seven series 3-0) NY RANGERS    4  Florida     3 (OT)</p>
<p>(Rangers lead best-of-seven series 2-1)</p>
<p>	     Western Conference</p>
<p> CHICAGO	 6  Colorado    3</p>
<p>(Best-of-seven series tied 2-2)  ST LOUIS	4  Detroit     0</p>
<p>(Best-of-seven series tied 2-2)  Dallas	  4  EDMONTON    3</p>
<p>(Best-of-seven series tied 2-2)  PHOENIX	 2  Anaheim     0</p>
<p>(Best-of-seven series tied 2-2)</p>
